hypotheses.statement:
Suppose $Q(x)\ge C>0$, where $C$ is an integer and $w(x)=6d_0$ with $d_0>0$. Put $$z=\min\left(18,\ \min\left\{h\ge0:
                              \binom{d_0+h}{h}\ge C\right\}\right).$$ Then for all $k\ge1$, $$\label{eq:power}
                Q(kx)\ge f(C,z,k).$$

